Observe the independently computed RNG state in native presentation journals.

The supported original Watcom LCG stores its state at thread_data+12.
The optional reference DirectDraw observer reads this after each successful
presentation. This read-only getter records the port's own seed and call count
for that comparison; it never initializes or advances the generator and does
not change ordinary rendering, inputs, or random results. A matching seed is
not a proof of every random call site or of the original call count.

--- a/dd2_stubs.c
+++ b/dd2_stubs.c
@@ -196,3 +196,4 @@
     return (int)value;
 }
 void srand(unsigned seed){_dd2_rand_seed=seed;}
+unsigned dd2_random_current_seed(void){return _dd2_rand_seed;}
--- a/dd2_com.c
+++ b/dd2_com.c
@@ -216,11 +216,12 @@
